# Ren'Py
# website: https://www.renpy.org
# docs: https://www.renpy.org/doc/html/
# description: Ren'Py visual novel engine ignore rules for compiled scripts, saves, cache, and diagnostic logs.

# Save data and persistent state
saves/
persistent
game/saves/navigation.json

# Engine diagnostic and runtime logs
errors.txt
log.txt
progressive_download.txt
traceback.txt

# Backups
*.bak

# Compiled bytecode and script archives
*.rpyc
*.rpyb
*.rpymc

# Cache
cache/